1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,150
She said "I'm fine"

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,650
214 times in one year.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,150
Her sister kept count

4
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,650
on a yellow sticky note.

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,450
The tally started the week

6
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,550
she got passed over for a promotion.

7
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:11,350
Each "I'm fine" came with

8
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,250
the same smile

9
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:14,050
and the same quick subject change.

10
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,450
The sticky note sat on the fridge,

11
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,550
and she never once looked at it.

12
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,350
Her sister wasn't counting lies.

13
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,150
She was counting every chance

14
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,050
to ask again.

15
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,450
At tally 20, her sister asked once,

16
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:26,350
then dropped it.

17
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,450
At tally 80, she stopped asking

18
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,950
in front of the family.

19
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,350
At tally 150, she wrote a letter

20
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,550
and never sent it.

21
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,950
At tally 214, she pulled the note

22
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:36,850
off the fridge

23
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:38,650
and put it on the table.

24
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,350
"I'm fine" is a door you close politely,

25
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:42,550
and people stop knocking.

26
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:43,750
Try this instead:

27
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:44,950
"I'm not okay yet,

28
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,450
but I'm working on it."

29
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:47,650
I'm Dimples.

30
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,050
I talk about the things we feel

31
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:51,550
but never say out loud.

32
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:52,750
Follow for more.
